# SPEC §24 — local-development secret for the admin shim.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in.
#
# In production admin is protected by Cloudflare Access, which authenticates the
# request before it reaches the Worker. ADMIN_TOKEN exists only so `wrangler dev`
# and `curl` have a way in. It is deliberately NOT set in wrangler.jsonc.
ADMIN_TOKEN="replace-me-with-a-long-random-string"
